{
  "title": "ComponentFor",
  "description": "Any component a node of type `H` accepts: one whose declared host type is `H` or a supertype of it, the rule SceneNode.addComponent applies. Types a list of components for one kind of node, such as the JSX `components` prop, where each element is checked on its own. The check also holds for consumers that compile without `strictFunctionTypes`. It has the public members of Component but no declared host type, so `addComponent` does not accept a value of this type; keep the component's own type for that.",
