      "paragraphs": [
        "Any component a node of type `H` accepts: one whose declared host type is `H` or a supertype of it, the rule SceneNode.addComponent applies. Types a list of components for one kind of node, such as the JSX `components` prop, where each element is checked on its own. The check also holds for consumers that compile without `strictFunctionTypes`.",
